what is terraform?
  Terraform is an infrastructure as code tool used for managing & provisioning of infrastructure such as ec2 instances,s3 buckets & other cloud resources
  using code instead of manual processes.

why do devops engineers use terraform ?
  DevOps engineers use Terraform mainly to automate and manage infrastructure.
uses :
Automation – creates AWS/Azure resources automatically.

Infrastructure as Code (IaC) – infrastructure is written in configuration files.

Consistency – creates the same infrastructure every time.

Easy scaling – quickly create or remove multiple resources.

Version control – Terraform files can be stored in Git and tracked.

Less manual work and fewer errors.

What is Infrastructure as Code?
  it is the practice of managing and provisioning of infrastructure using code instead  of manual process
  IAC lets you to create templates in json r yaml format mentioning the aws resources & configurations that r required for ur application

What is a .tf file?
  .tf is the file extension for terraform configuration files.
  it contains the configuration (code r instructions) of the infrastructure that terraform needs to manage such as ec2 instances,vpcs.

What is a Terraform provider?
  a terraform provider is a plugin that acts as a bridge r communication provider b/w terraform & an external platform such as aws,azure r k8s.

What is a resource?
  a terraform resource is the actual thing that you want terraform  to create r manage.
  example : if u want to create an ec2 server on aws,the ec2 server is the resource.
  provider -> connects terraform to aws ,azure etc.
  resource -> the thing u want to create r manage.

What is terraform init?
  terraform init is the first command we usually run in a Terraform project.
  terraform init prepares the Terraform project and downloads the required providers and other dependencies.

What is terraform plan?
  terraform plan shows u what changes terraform is going to make before actually making them.
  it does not create r change the infrastructure. it only shows what terraform plans to do.

What is terraform apply?
  terraform apply actually creates r changes the infrastructure acc. to  your terraform configuration.
  it is used to apply the changes defined in the terraform configuration & create ,update,r delete the required infrastructure resources.
  
terraform init
       ↓
terraform plan
       ↓
terraform apply

  init → Prepare the project
  plan → Show what Terraform will do
  apply → Actually create/change the resources
  
  
  
